183	     * Edits a claim; its due-by, and so its period, stay as they were fixed. Refused unless it is a draft, when its
184	     * due-by falls in a closed period, and for a claim with lines when the amount is not the one its lines make. An open claim is changed by voiding it and adding a new one.
185	     */
186	    @Transactional
187	    public Claim update(String by, String sheetId, Long id, BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note,
188	            String corrects, String ref, String tagged) {
